From 9bdaeb48527c08df8026d32143325e207755f199 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "vincent.yen" <vincent.yen@mitaccomputing.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 22:53:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add MiTAC image signature verification

Verify the firmware public key against a trusted activation key, validate
the image signing chain, and verify each firmware artifact signature.
Support RSA and ECDSA keys stored as X.509 certificates or PEM public
keys.

Add the verify-mitac-signature Meson option and perform verification for
both BMC and Host firmware activation.

Test:
Update keys for the mitac-signing-keys repository.
Built phosphor-software-manager with verify-mitac-signature enabled.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [No upstream maintenance]
